BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 660.0 Tm (metadata update may alter a directory record, one or more FAT sectors, and file data; a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 643.0 Tm (power failure between writes can leave orphaned or multiply linked clusters. A safe checker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 626.0 Tm (validates both FAT copies, directory trees, file lengths, the cluster graph and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 609.0 Tm (out-of-range records before proposing repairs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 580.0 Tm (To discriminate FAT12, FAT16 and FAT32, first compute root-directory sectors, the first) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 563.0 Tm (data sector, total data sectors and cluster count using the published algorithm. Do not) Tj ET
